# winoracle (Windows 11 26200, Microsoft Basic Render Driver / WARP), 2026-09-28.
# x64 and x86 builds print identical lines; the '# d3d11_video_formats_probe (N-bit)' banner is a comment.
# Summary: AYUV/Y410/Y416 are one element-view texel a pixel (R8G8B8A8 / R10G10B10A2 /
# R16G16B16A16; AYUV also renders, mips and autogen; Y416 mips); YUY2/Y210/Y216 are one texel a
# pixel pair (even width, 1 mip, odd box/copy edges dropped); views only through the Learn element
# formats (+ R32_UINT UAVs of AYUV/Y410/YUY2, + YUY2's full-width R8G8_B8G8_UNORM SRV); 420_OPAQUE is
# DEFAULT, bind 0, no initial data, even W/H, <= 2 slices; P8/A8P8 are bind-0 DEFAULT or STAGING, 1 mip;
# NV11/AI44/IA44/P208/V208/V408 never create. The device answers no ID3D11VideoDevice (with or
# without VIDEO_SUPPORT); the immediate context answers ID3D11VideoContext..3.
# d3d11_video_formats_probe (64-bit)
